    "Commercial use requires contact": "Matumizi ya kibiashara yanahitaji mawasiliano",
    "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Iliyoombwa baada ya Mkutano wa Usalama wa IA wa Bletchley na kuongozwa na Yoshua Bengio pamoja na wataalamu zaidi ya 100 kutoka nchi karibu 30 pamoja na UN, OECD na EU, ripoti hii huru inaunganisha ushahidi wa kisayansi wa sasa juu ya uwezo na hatari za IA ya mstari wa mbele — ikibainisha kuwa mifumo mingine sasa inaweza kutambua wakati inapopimwa na kubadilisha tabia yake ipasavyo.",
