    "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Uwekaji sahihi: rasimu huru za utafiti, mapendekezo ya protokoli, na jaribio la vipimo wazi.",
    "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Ilirekebisha chaguo-msingi la awali: Ubelgiji (BE) sasa unaelekezwa kwenye kiholanzi badala ya kifaransa — wasemaji wa kiflemi ni wengi zaidi nchini (~60%) kuliko wasemaji wa kifaransa wa Wallonia (~40%).",
    "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Ilirekebisha chaguo-msingi la awali: Kazakhstan (KZ) sasa unaelekezwa kwenye kikazaki badala ya kirusi, kwa kuwa sasa kuna tafsiri ya kikazaki — aina ile ile ya urekebishaji kama ile ya Ubelgiji hapo awali.",
    "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
