    "Custom tier": "Daraja maalum",
    "Daily Nous reports on a retracted Journal of Medical Ethics submission containing multiple fabricated, AI-hallucinated references — complete with fake university affiliations and defunct email addresses — that the author reportedly left uncorrected even after being given a chance to fix proofs. The piece contrasts this with Bioethics, whose automated reference-checking would have caught the problem, and argues the real bottleneck isn't detection technology (one commenter's script flagged the fake citations in under a minute) but unpaid reviewer labor and publishing incentives that reward throughput over scrutiny.": "Daily Nous inaripoti juu ya hati iliyorudishwa nyuma iliyotumwa kwa Journal of Medical Ethics, iliyokuwa na marejeo mengi ya uongo, yaliyobuniwa na IA — pamoja na uhusiano wa uongo na vyuo vikuu na anwani za barua pepe zisizofanya kazi — ambazo mwandishi anasemekana hakuzirekebisha hata baada ya kupewa nafasi ya kurekebisha. Makala hii inalinganisha hali hiyo na Bioethics, ambayo ukaguzi wake wa kiotomatiki wa marejeo ungeligundua tatizo hilo, na inasema kuwa kizuizi halisi si teknolojia ya ugunduzi (skripti ya mtoa maoni mmoja iligundua manukuu ya uongo kwa chini ya dakika moja) bali kazi ya wakaguzi isiyolipwa na motisha za uchapishaji zinazothawabisha wingi kuliko uangalifu.",
    "Data free-riding vs. trillion-dollar AI valuations": "Kutumia takwimu bila malipo dhidi ya thamani za IA za matrilioni ya dola",
    "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI": "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI",
    "Demis Hassabis proposed a FINRA-style regulator for frontier model releases: labs would submit models for review up to 30 days before deployment, voluntary at first, with a path toward mandatory compliance in the US market.": "Demis Hassabis alipendekeza msimamizi wa mtindo wa FINRA kwa ajili ya kutolewa kwa modeli za mstari wa mbele: maabara zingewasilisha modeli kwa ukaguzi hadi siku 30 kabla ya kutumika, kwa hiari mwanzoni, na njia kuelekea uzingatiaji wa lazima katika soko la Marekani.",
    "Denied": "Kataliwa",
    "Deployable policy starter template": "Kiolezo cha awali cha sera kinachoweza kutumika",
    "Deployable policy starter template at /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — a minimal static site with the full machine-readable layer, ready for Cloudflare Pages or any static host.": "Kiolezo cha awali cha sera kinachoweza kutumika katika /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — tovuti tulivu ndogo yenye safu kamili inayosomwa na masini, tayari kwa Cloudflare Pages au mwenyeji wowote tulivu.",
    "Deploying machine-readable policies on your site": "Kutumia sera zinazosomwa na masini katika tovuti yako",
    "Disclaimer": "Tahadhari",
    "Distinct from human UI, SEO, or plain APIs, the AI Ingestion & Capability Layer gives websites a machine-facing architecture: a Manifest Layer (entry points like /llms.txt and /ai/manifest.json), a Corpus Layer (machine-readable knowledge), a Capability Layer (agent-callable tools), and a Governance Layer (provenance, licensing, versioning). Static-first, upgradeable toward APIs and MCP. Note: in this paper AICL names the ingestion architecture; on this site's protocol pages AICL refers to the AI Content Licensing Layer.": "Tofauti na UI ya binadamu, SEO, au API za kawaida, Safu ya Uchukuaji na Uwezo wa IA inapa tovuti muundo unaoelekea masini: Safu ya Manifest (milango ya kuingia kama /llms.txt na /ai/manifest.json), Safu ya Corpus (maarifa yanayosomwa na masini), Safu ya Uwezo (vyombo vinavyoweza kuitwa na wakala), na Safu ya Utawala (asili, lisansi, matoleo). Inaanza kwa tulivu, inaweza kupandishwa kuelekea API na MCP. Dokezo: katika hati hii AICL inataja muundo wa uchukuaji; katika kurasa za protokoli za tovuti hii AICL inarejelea Safu ya Lisansi ya Contenu ya IA.",
    "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm": "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm",
    "Docs": "Hati",
    "Docs / Examples": "Hati / Mifano",
    "Document library": "Maktaba ya hati",
    "Does AI have rights — and which framings are even coherent?": "Je, IA ina haki — na ni mifumo ipi ya kufikiri iliyo na mantiki kabisa?",
    "Download": "Pakua",
    "Draft status": "Hali ya rasimu",
    "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026": "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026",
    "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Onyesho la kielimu: HMAC-SHA256 na siri iliyoshirikiwa, likionyesha tokeni za lisansi zilizofungwa kwa ombi, zenye muda wa mwisho, na zinazoweza kuhakikiwa. Tokeni za uzalishaji zinapasa kusainiwa kwa njia isiyo na ulinganifu, na ufunguo wa umma wa mchapishaji ukiwa unapatikana chini ya /.well-known/.",
    "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Maingizo manane zaidi ya /topics, safari hii yaliyotafitiwa na wakala wa IA badala ya kuchaguliwa kwa mkono — kaida ile ile kama awali: kila chanzo kimechukuliwa na kuthibitishwa kikiwa hai, muhtasari ni ufafanuzi wa asili, kabla ya kitu chochote kuongezwa. Maingizo 14 kwa jumla.",
    "Email": "Barua pepe",
