    "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Hakikisha uwazi unatekelezeka na masini — ili nia njema isitupwe kama hali ya kutokuwa na uhakika wa kisheria.",
    "Epistemology": "Elimu ya maarifa",
